<!--
  The status bar icon, and the themed-icon layer of the launcher icon.

  Android draws a notification's small icon as a SILHOUETTE: every non-
  transparent pixel is repainted in the system's own colour. A full-colour
  square therefore arrives in the status bar as a solid white block, which is
  what the app icon was being used for. This is the same board drawn as a
  shape, so it survives that treatment.
-->
